        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每行一门课程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One course per line with the columns name, teacher, room, weekday, periods and weeks. Add a header row (English or Chinese) to use any column order. Rows copied from Excel or Numbers work too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每行一门课程，列依次为：课程、教师、教室、星期、节次、周次。加上标题行（中英文均可）后可以使用任意列顺序。也可以直接粘贴从 Excel 或 Numbers 复制的行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One word per line, optionally followed by a meaning; or CSV with a header row (word, meaning, phonetic, pos, example)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每行一个单词，后面可以跟释义；也可以用带表头的 CSV（word、meaning、phonetic、pos、example）。"
          }
