            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "学会后又遗忘两次及以上的单词会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You get a notification at that time, or when the class ends. A class's to-dos also show in its Live Activity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "到时间或下课时会收到通知。课后待办也会显示在这节课的实时活动中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline. Connect to the internet and try again." : {
